      "source": "Generic String to byte[] (and back) serializer. Relies on the Spring <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a> to transform objects\ninto String and vice versa. The Strings are convert into bytes and vice-versa using the specified charset (by default\nUTF-8). <b>Note:</b> The conversion service initialization happens automatically if the class is defined as a Spring\nbean. <b>Note:</b> Does not handle nulls in any special way delegating everything to the container.",
      "translation": "通用字符串与 byte[]（及其反向）序列化器。该序列化器依赖 Spring 的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a>将对象转换为字符串，反之亦然。指定的字符集（默认为 UTF-8）用于在字符串与字节之间进行转换。<b>注意：</b>如果该类被定义为 Spring  Bean，则转换服务的初始化会自动发生。<b>注意：</b>不对 null 值进行任何特殊处理，而是将所有操作委托给容器。",
      "count": 1
    },
